{"id": "De53mGnx_Sa", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Ravana set Hanuman's tail on fire… BIG mistake! 🔥🐒 How did Lanka burn? | Ramayan Part 10 of 12\n\n💎 Sita gave Hanuman her hair jewel (chudamani) to take to Ram. (Valmiki Ramayana, Sundara Kanda 38)\n🌳 Before leaving, Hanuman thought: \"Let's test Ravana's strength!\" He smashed the whole Ashoka grove… except the tree where Sita sat. (Sundara 41–42)\n💥 Ravana sent his army, and even his son Akshaya. All defeated! (Sundara 42–47)\n✨ Then Indrajit fired the Brahmastra. Hanuman let it hold him, so he could meet Ravana face to face. (Sundara 48)\n👑 In Ravana's court, Hanuman said: \"Give Sita back!\" Ravana roared: \"Kill him!\" But Vibhishana said: \"Never kill a messenger!\" (Sundara 51–52)\n🔥 So Ravana said: \"Set his tail on fire!\" Sita prayed to Agni: \"Be cool for him!\" And the fire felt cool. (Sundara 53)\n🏯 Hanuman slipped his ropes, leapt from roof to roof, and Lanka burned. But he spared Vibhishana's house. (Sundara 54)\n🌊 He put out his tail in the sea, then panicked: \"Is Sita safe?!\" She was. Not one hair burned. (Sundara 54–56)\n\n➡️ Part 11: Ram vs the Ocean! Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it!\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books tell our gods' stories for kids, in simple words and bright pictures → rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment JAI BAJRANGBALI 🙏\n🔖 Save this, and share it with a Hanuman bhakt 🧡\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #hanuman #bajrangbali #jaibajrangbali #lankadahan #sundarakand #valmikiramayana #ravana #jaishriram #sanatandharma #hindumythology #ramayanseries #rishikatha #mythologyforkids", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792903257, "like_count": 1359, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1775298857075873a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.127, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acod